$0(){return A.jR(this.a,"# Telegraph \u2014 a beacon with two clocks.\nname Telegraph\n#\n# DRONE: a Timer555 pulse fanned out by Copy2Pcm into two destinies \u2014\n#   - BODY: LowPass'd, ungated. The warm low end is always present.\n#   - GLITTER: HighPass \u2192 Distortion \u2192 Bitcrusher, gated by seqA at\n#     168 BPM. The bright edge punches in and out, leaving the body\n#     to carry the silences. Mix2Pcm with normalize=false keeps the body\n#     at full level when the glitter is off.\n#\n# LEAD: ClassicOscillator triangle, gated by seqB at 75 BPM with a\n#   sparse 8-step pattern. Delay (heavy feedback) drags each hit into\n#   the next silence; BandPass tames the wash into a vocal-ish smear.\n#\n# Two coprime BPMs (168 vs 75) plus two different patterns mean the\n# combined groove drifts \u2014 the overall texture never quite repeats,\n# and the same sequencers double as timbre and rhythm modulators.\n\n# --- Two clocks ---\nfilter Sequencer8 seqA\nknob seqA bpm 168.0\nknob seqA step_1 true\nknob seqA step_2 false\nknob seqA step_3 true\nknob seqA step_4 true\nknob seqA step_5 false\nknob seqA step_6 true\nknob seqA step_7 false\nknob seqA step_8 true\n\nfilter Sequencer8 seqB\nknob seqB bpm 75.0\nknob seqB step_1 true\nknob seqB step_2 false\nknob seqB step_3 false\nknob seqB step_4 true\nknob seqB step_5 false\nknob seqB step_6 false\nknob seqB step_7 true\nknob seqB step_8 false\n\n# --- DRONE source: pulse fanned out into body + glitter ---\nfilter Timer555 drone\nknob drone freq 73.0\nknob drone duty_cycle 0.28\n\nfilter Copy2Pcm dronecp\npatch drone out_pcm -> dronecp in_pcm\n\n# Body: warm low end, ungated. Always sounds.\nfilter LowPass body\nknob body cutoff 320.0\npatch dronecp out_pcm_a -> body in_pcm\n\n# Glitter: bright edge \u2192 distortion \u2192 crush; gated by seqA at the\n# very end of the chain so the upstream filters keep running and the\n# gate is a clean snap rather than an upstream re-trigger.\nfilter HighPass glitterhp\nknob glitterhp cutoff 1500.0\npatch dronecp out_pcm_b -> glitterhp in_pcm\n\nfilter Distortion glitterdist\nknob glitterdist drive 3.2\nknob glitterdist mix 0.8\npatch glitterhp out_pcm -> glitterdist in_pcm\n\nfilter Bitcrusher glittercrush\nknob glittercrush target_rate 9000.0\nknob glittercrush bit_depth 6\nknob glittercrush mix 0.55\npatch glitterdist out_pcm -> glittercrush in_pcm\n\n# Glitter amp: the VCA. seqA's gate drives the gain CV (low -> silence),\n# punching the bright edge in and out.\nfilter Volume glitteramp\npatch glittercrush out_pcm -> glitteramp in_pcm\npatch seqA out_gate -> glitteramp in_gain_cv\n\n# Drone recombine. normalize=false so body level doesn't change when\n# the glitter silences \u2014 body must carry the rhythm gaps.\nfilter Mix2Pcm dronemix\nknob dronemix normalize false\npatch body out_pcm -> dronemix in_pcm_a\npatch glitteramp out_pcm -> dronemix in_pcm_b\n\n# --- LEAD: triangle gated by seqB, with a long delay tail ---\nfilter ClassicOscillator lead\nknob lead freq 392.0\nknob lead waveform 3\n\n# Gate the lead at a VCA *before* the delay, so each hit is shaped but the\n# delay tail still rings out into the silences.\nfilter Volume leadamp\npatch lead out_pcm -> leadamp in_pcm\npatch seqB out_gate -> leadamp in_gain_cv\n\nfilter Delay leaddly\nknob leaddly time 0.42\nknob leaddly feedback 0.65\nknob leaddly mix 0.55\npatch leadamp out_pcm -> leaddly in_pcm\n\nfilter BandPass leadbp\nknob leadbp low_cutoff 380.0\nknob leadbp high_cutoff 2200.0\npatch leaddly out_pcm -> leadbp in_pcm\n\n# --- Final mix + master gain ---\nfilter Mix2Pcm outmix\nknob outmix normalize true\npatch dronemix out_pcm -> outmix in_pcm_a\npatch leadbp out_pcm -> outmix in_pcm_b\n\nfilter Volume master\nknob master volume 0.7\npatch outmix out_pcm -> master in_pcm\n\noutput master out_pcm\n\n"+A.hZ())},
