$0(){return A.jR(this.a,"# Surreal Drone \u2014 two voices, gated lead, dreamy halo, formant drone.\nname Surreal Drone\n#\n# DRONE (osc1, continuous): a thin pulse train shoved through a narrow\n#   BandPass \u2014 sits low, with a vocal-formant tint.\n#\n# LEAD (osc2): one triangle wave, Copy2Pcm'd into two parallel destinies \u2014\n#   - STAB:  Distortion -> HighPass, gated rhythmically by Sequencer8.\n#            Only fires on the gate-high steps; silent otherwise.\n#   - HALO:  LowPass -> Delay (heavy feedback). Always-on, smeared,\n#            keeps singing under the stab and into the silences.\n#   The two destinies recombine through a non-normalising Mix2Pcm so the\n#   halo stays full while the stab punches in and out. Light Bitcrusher\n#   on the lead-soup adds grit.\n#\n# Final Mix2Pcm weds drone + lead-soup; Volume is just gain \u2014 NOT the gate.\n\n# Syncopated dali-pattern at 25 BPM (= 25 full cycles per minute,\n# ~300ms per step, ~2.4s per cycle).\nfilter Sequencer8 seq1\nknob seq1 bpm 25.0\nknob seq1 step_1 true\nknob seq1 step_2 false\nknob seq1 step_3 false\nknob seq1 step_4 true\nknob seq1 step_5 true\nknob seq1 step_6 false\nknob seq1 step_7 true\nknob seq1 step_8 false\n\n# ----- Drone voice (ungated) ----------------------------------------\n# Thin pulse-train, narrow band gives a low formant.\nfilter Timer555 osc1\nknob osc1 freq 73.0\nknob osc1 duty_cycle 0.2\n\nfilter BandPass bp1\nknob bp1 low_cutoff 120.0\nknob bp1 high_cutoff 380.0\n\npatch osc1 out_pcm -> bp1 in_pcm\n\n# ----- Lead source split into stab + halo ---------------------------\nfilter ClassicOscillator osc2\nknob osc2 freq 293.0\nknob osc2 waveform 3\n\nfilter Copy2Pcm cp1\npatch osc2 out_pcm -> cp1 in_pcm\n\n# STAB: gritty, brittle, only on gate-high steps.\nfilter Distortion dist1\nknob dist1 drive 4.5\nknob dist1 mix 0.9\n\nfilter HighPass hp1\nknob hp1 cutoff 800.0\n\npatch cp1 out_pcm_a -> dist1 in_pcm\npatch dist1 out_pcm -> hp1 in_pcm\n\n# Stab amp: the VCA. seq1's gate drives the gain CV \u2014 only fires on the\n# gate-high steps; silent otherwise.\nfilter Volume stabamp\npatch hp1 out_pcm -> stabamp in_pcm\npatch seq1 out_gate -> stabamp in_gain_cv\n\n# HALO: warm, always-on, with a long feedback echo so silences breathe.\nfilter LowPass lp1\nknob lp1 cutoff 420.0\n\nfilter Delay dly1\nknob dly1 time 0.37\nknob dly1 feedback 0.6\nknob dly1 mix 0.55\n\npatch cp1 out_pcm_b -> lp1 in_pcm\npatch lp1 out_pcm -> dly1 in_pcm\n\n# Recombine stab + halo. normalize=false \u2192 halo stays at full level\n# whether or not the stab is firing (so the silences aren't quieter).\nfilter Mix2Pcm mix_lead\nknob mix_lead normalize false\npatch stabamp out_pcm -> mix_lead in_pcm_a\npatch dly1 out_pcm -> mix_lead in_pcm_b\n\n# Light grit on the whole lead soup before it meets the drone.\nfilter Bitcrusher crush1\nknob crush1 target_rate 6000.0\nknob crush1 bit_depth 6\nknob crush1 mix 0.4\npatch mix_lead out_pcm -> crush1 in_pcm\n\n# ----- Drone + lead-soup -> final volume ----------------------------\nfilter Mix2Pcm mix_out\npatch bp1 out_pcm -> mix_out in_pcm_a\npatch crush1 out_pcm -> mix_out in_pcm_b\n\nfilter Volume vol1\nknob vol1 volume 0.55\npatch mix_out out_pcm -> vol1 in_pcm\n\noutput vol1 out_pcm\n\n"+A.hZ())},
